  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet omfattar utbildning och r&#xe5;dgivning inom bl.a. lagstiftning, v&#xe4;rdering och taxering samt fastighetsregistrering. Den svenska samarbetsparten &#xe4;r Swedsurvey. Det totala projektst&#xf6;det &#xe4;r 5 880 000 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training and consultation within the sector of land administration and land management. The overall aim is to contribute to economic growth and sustinable development by establishing a civilised land and real property market and land tenure rights protection. Swedish counterpart is Swedsurvey. Total project amount: 5 880 000 SEK.</narrative>
